<title>UK: BP raises LPG prices to $323 and $265 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP raises LPG prices to $323 and $265 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BP announced on Friday that it has raised its liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) prices, the BP Agreed Price (BPAP), for December to $323 a tonne for propane and $265 a tonne for butane.</p>
<p>This is a rise of $59 a tonne for propane and $32.50 for butane.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
